---
description: Commit messages do not credit Cursor
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commits

A commit message or Perforce changelist description is only the change itself. This applies to git commits and Perforce submits.

Do not add a Cursor attribution, trailer, or link. In particular, do not append:

```
Made with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)
```

```
Co-authored-by: Cursor
```
